# SM8550 on Linux 7.4: no options of its own (kernel-common/steamos.config
# applies). 7.4 dropped the C binder driver (ANDROID_BINDER_IPC,
# ANDROID_BINDERFS, ANDROID_BINDER_DEVICES): the common fragment's binder
# lines cannot apply here, only Rust binder (ANDROID_BINDER_IPC_RUST, needs
# RUST) is left. NETFILTER_XT_TARGET_NAT became NETFILTER_XT_NAT, which the
# common fragment already sets. Both show up as WARN lines in the build log.
